  <section>
<div class="os-raise-familysupport">
  <para>Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
</div>

<para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item> Enter the given data into Desmos, then calculate the regression approximation to determine the curve of best fit.

    <table class="os-raise-skinnytable">
      <thead>
