</list>
<div class="os-raise-ib-desmos-gc" data-bottom="-60" data-left="-10" data-right="50" data-schema-version="1.0" data-top="350"/>
<para>What is the equation for the curve of best fit that models the data?</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="2bb7ca48-10c1-470e-8d66-afc1bebad136"><problem><newline/><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(y = -0.93x^2+ 22.63x + 10.48\)</para><para>\(y = -0.69x^2+ 24.83x + 8.07\)</para><para>\(y = -3.11x^2+ 16.32x + 8.94\)</para><para>\(y = -0.7x^2 + 35.93x + 8.19\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(y = -0.69x^2+ 24.83x + 8.07\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(y = -0.69x^2+ 24.83x + 8.07\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section><!--2-->
